stral.sh/ty/"}],"license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/astral-sh/ty/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","moniker":"ty","name":"ty","packageUrl":"https://github.com/astral-sh/ty","publisher":"Astral Software Inc.","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/astral-sh/ty/issues","publisherUrl":"https://astral.sh/","releaseNotes":"Core type checking\n- Added support for return type inference for unannotated functions and methods (#29253).\n  Return type inference is currently disabled by default. Enable it with the analysis.return-type-inference setting in pyproject.toml:\n  [tool.ty.analysis]\n  return-type-inference = \"always\"\n  Or in ty.toml:\n  [analysis]\n  return-type-inference = \"always\"\n  Please share your feedback, especially any problems you encounter, in the return type inference feedback issue.\n- Sync vendored typeshed stubs (#29402). Typeshed diff\n\nBug fixes\n- Avoid a panic when negating dynamic type aliases (#29427)\n- Widen tuple literal lengths when other collection elements contain nested tuple types (#29147)\n- Report invalid Generic and Protocol arguments containing nested variadic type variables (#29146)\n\nPerformance\n- Speed up generic class-pattern narrowing by skipping impossible intersection comparisons (#29240)\n\nContributors\n- @carljm\n- @charliermarsh\n- @sharkdp","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/astral-sh/ty/releases/tag/0.0.89","tags":["python"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/astral-sh/ty/issues","publisherUrl":"https://astral.sh/","releaseDate":"2026-11-05","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/astral-sh/ty/releases/tag/0.0.89","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"a4a78ef7dd5a1ec000e60392173b33bed55f7cbb","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/a/astral-sh/ty/0.0.89/astral-sh.ty.installer.yaml","sha256":"acf3d05ed9d5059463537c77ccc6b40722710a3049924fd9c21d6c76d2690a4f"},{"path":"manifests/a/astral-sh/ty/0.0.89/astral-sh.ty.locale.en